course: dictionary
lesson: 5565
title: Spotting the clues in leopard
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A leopard is a big wild cat with yellow fur covered in dark spots. Those spots are called rosettes. Use the words around a new word to work out what it means, just as you would with any other word.
explain: «Vervet monkeys have different alarm calls for leopards, eagles and snakes: at the leopard call they run up trees.» The clue is the running up trees. A leopard is something that is dangerous to a monkey, and it is a predator that attacks from the ground.
explain: Be careful with clues in other words. «Leopard seals are big hunters with powerful jaws and long teeth.» Here leopard is part of a name, and the clues, hunters and teeth, show that it is a sea animal, not a cat.
fact: A leopard is a big wild cat with yellow fur and dark spots called rosettes.
fact: Leopards live in Africa and parts of Asia, and they are strong climbers.
fact: Leopards often drag their food up into trees to keep it safe from lions and hyenas.
fact: «Leopard print» is a pattern on clothes that looks like a leopard's spots.
fact: «Leopard seals» are a different animal from the big cat, so the word leopard in their name does not mean a cat.
exercise: «A leopard dragged its food up into a tree to keep it safe.» Why did the leopard climb with its food? | To cool down in the sun | To see the sea better | To hide from its own cubs | *To keep it safe from lions and hyenas
exercise: «The leopard's spots help it hide in the shade.» What are the dark marks on a leopard's fur called? | *Rosettes | Scales | Quills | Stripes
exercise: Jayden says leopard seals must be cats because of their name. What is the right answer? | They are a kind of big cat with spots | *They are seals, a different animal from the big cat | They are cats that live in the sea | They are monkeys
test: In the sentence «at the leopard call they run up trees», what do the monkeys do? | Stand and look at the ground | Dive into bushes | *Run up trees | Sing loudly
test: «A black panther is not a separate animal but a dark leopard or jaguar.» What is a black panther? | A kind of bird | A separate kind of animal | A seal | *A dark leopard or jaguar
exam: What is a leopard? | A bird that lives in trees | *A big wild cat with yellow fur covered in dark spots | A zebra striped only at the front | A kind of seal that eats krill
